<Defs>
  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>LiAIChat_Topic_PracticalReason</defName>
    <label>专题：实践理性批判</label>
    <description>围绕义务、自由与人格尊严开展专题研讨。需要殖民地收藏已识别的《实践理性批判》。完成后随机获得一项持续 7 天的殖民者加成。</description>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="LiAIChat.Civilization.CivilizationTopicExtension">
        <requiredText>LiAIChat_Text_Kant_CritiqueOfPracticalReason</requiredText>
        <conclusion>在艰难处境中说明行动的理由，尊重彼此的人格，比把同伴当作工具更能维持共同生活。</conclusion>
        <bonuses>
          <li><id>duty</id><label>自觉履责：全局工作速度 +10%</label><stat>WorkSpeedGlobal</stat><factor>1.10</factor></li>
          <li><id>dignity</id><label>人格尊重：社交斗殴概率 −30%</label><effect>SocialFight</effect><factor>0.70</factor></li>
          <li><id>resolve</id><label>坚定意志：心情下降速度 −25%</label><effect>MoodDecline</effect><factor>0.75</factor></li>
          <li><id>autonomy</id><label>理性自律：精神崩溃阈值 −5 个百分点（更稳定）</label><stat>MentalBreakThreshold</stat><offset>-0.05</offset></li>
        </bonuses>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <baseCost>3000</baseCost><techLevel>Industrial</techLevel><tab>LiAIChat_CivilizationTopics</tab><researchViewX>1</researchViewX><researchViewY>1</researchViewY>
  </ResearchProjectDef>
  <ResearchProjectDef>
    <defName>LiAIChat_Topic_Meditations</defName>
