  <ResearchProjectDef><defName>LiAIChat_Topic_Prince</defName><label>专题：君主论</label><description>围绕风险、权力、威慑与决断开展专题研讨。需要殖民地收藏已识别的《君主论》。</description><modExtensions><li Class="LiAIChat.Civilization.CivilizationTopicExtension"><requiredText>LiAIChat_Text_Machiavelli_Prince</requiredText><conclusion>在险境中作出决断并不等于崇拜权力；能看清风险和后果，才有可能为共同体承担责任。</conclusion><bonuses><li><id>decisiveness</id><label>果断：射击命中率 +8%</label><stat>ShootingAccuracyPawn</stat><factor>1.08</factor></li><li><id>calculation</id><label>审时度势：谈判能力 +12%</label><stat>NegotiationAbility</stat><factor>1.12</factor></li><li><id>deterrence</id><label>威慑：精神崩溃阈值 −4 个百分点（更稳定）</label><stat>MentalBreakThreshold</stat><offset>-0.04</offset></li></bonuses></li></modExtensions><baseCost>3200</baseCost><techLevel>Industrial</techLevel><tab>LiAIChat_CivilizationTopics</tab><researchViewX>1</researchViewX><researchViewY>5</researchViewY></ResearchProjectDef>
  <ResearchProjectDef><defName>LiAIChat_Topic_SocialContract</defName><label>专题：社会契约论</label><description>围绕公共意志、平等与共同规则开展专题研讨。需要殖民地收藏已识别的《社会契约论》。</description><modExtensions><li Class="LiAIChat.Civilization.CivilizationTopicExtension"><requiredText>LiAIChat_Text_Rousseau_SocialContract</requiredText><conclusion>共同规则只有在每个人都能以公共理由理解和检验时，才不只是强者的命令。</conclusion><bonuses><li><id>cooperation</id><label>协作：全局工作速度 +8%</label><stat>WorkSpeedGlobal</stat><factor>1.08</factor></li><li><id>civility</id><label>公共礼让：社交斗殴概率 −25%</label><effect>SocialFight</effect><factor>0.75</factor></li><li><id>assembly</id><label>公共仪式：活动正面心情记忆效果 +20%</label><effect>GatheringMood</effect><factor>1.20</factor></li></bonuses></li></modExtensions><baseCost>3200</baseCost><techLevel>Industrial</techLevel><tab>LiAIChat_CivilizationTopics</tab><researchViewX>3</researchViewX><researchViewY>5</researchViewY></ResearchProjectDef>
