  <ResearchProjectDef><defName>LiAIChat_Topic_ArtOfWar</defName><label>专题：孙子兵法</label><description>围绕侦察、地形、欺骗与先机开展专题研讨。需要殖民地收藏已识别的《孙子兵法》。</description><modExtensions><li Class="LiAIChat.Civilization.CivilizationTopicExtension"><requiredText>LiAIChat_Text_SunTzu_ArtOfWar</requiredText><conclusion>先机来自观察、准备与避免无谓消耗；最可靠的胜利未必来自正面碰撞。</conclusion><bonuses><li><id>aim</id><label>知彼知己：射击命中率 +10%</label><stat>ShootingAccuracyPawn</stat><factor>1.10</factor></li><li><id>terrain</id><label>因地制宜：移动速度 +8%</label><stat>MoveSpeed</stat><factor>1.08</factor></li><li><id>concealment</id><label>隐蔽：狩猎隐蔽性 +20%</label><stat>HuntingStealth</stat><factor>1.20</factor></li><li><id>timing</id><label>先机：瞄准延迟 −15%</label><stat>AimingDelayFactor</stat><factor>0.85</factor></li></bonuses></li></modExtensions><baseCost>3200</baseCost><techLevel>Industrial</techLevel><tab>LiAIChat_CivilizationTopics</tab><researchViewX>11</researchViewX><researchViewY>5</researchViewY></ResearchProjectDef>
